# No Framer Motion

This project does **not** use Framer Motion. Do not add it or use any of its APIs.

## Forbidden

- `motion.div`, `motion.span`, or any `motion.*` component
- Imports from `framer-motion` or `motion` (the newer package name)
- `AnimatePresence`, `useAnimation`, `useScroll` / `useTransform` from Framer Motion, etc.

## Use instead

- Plain React elements (`div`, `span`, `svg`, …)
- **GSAP** (and **ScrollTrigger** when scroll-driven) for animation — patterns already used under `app/animations/` and related components

If you need entrance or scroll-linked effects, wire them with GSAP in effects / animation modules, not `motion` components.
